{
  "v": 1,
  "claim": "Each connected Claude account's limits were hard to see: an added account showed none until it ran a session, Default was not named, the limits sat in the model picker, and the picker did not say which account it was on. Effort was inside the model menu. Now yardd reads every Claude account's limits without a turn and the sidebar names each account over its meters; the picker shows models only and names the account; effort is its own chip.",
